WEBVTT

00:03.253 --> 00:05.755
<i>Causes of death are many and varied.</i>

00:06.464 --> 00:09.759
<i>Old age, suicide, illness…</i>

00:10.510 --> 00:15.223
<i>But the cause of death that scares</i>
<i>the most people in this day and age…</i>

00:19.394 --> 00:20.562
<i>…is death by fire.</i>

00:32.240 --> 00:34.701
Tamaki! Get out of there now!

00:36.870 --> 00:37.704
Take control of it!

00:37.787 --> 00:38.872
Yes, sir!

00:39.581 --> 00:41.624
A powerful second-generation…

00:41.708 --> 00:43.334
But it is futile.

00:44.210 --> 00:44.961
Maki-san!

00:49.674 --> 00:51.676
Thank you, sir.

00:52.260 --> 00:54.929
The end of your money
is the end of your life.

00:55.013 --> 00:58.433
I am more than enough to handle you.

00:58.516 --> 00:59.517
Let's go!

01:00.185 --> 01:04.522
The toll is the Company 8 spirit
that Captain Obi trained us in!

02:53.548 --> 02:54.966
By yourself?!

02:56.217 --> 02:58.678
-You think--
-Hold it, Tamaki.

02:58.761 --> 02:59.971
Here's what you asked for.

03:00.555 --> 03:03.349
I didn't have time to make more than this.

03:04.309 --> 03:05.560
Only two?

03:05.643 --> 03:08.396
No, that's more than enough.
They won't go to waste!

03:08.479 --> 03:09.689
She's making a move!

03:11.024 --> 03:13.651
Bullets are not good enough.

03:13.735 --> 03:18.656
It does not count for the toll,
but I will take something else.

03:19.157 --> 03:21.451
You have something very nice there.

03:23.077 --> 03:24.287
The shield!

03:27.165 --> 03:28.416
Tekkyo!

03:32.712 --> 03:34.255
-Sputter!
-Flare…

03:36.049 --> 03:38.551
<i>What's her pyrokinetic power?</i>

03:38.635 --> 03:40.845
<i>She manipulates metals…</i>

03:40.929 --> 03:41.804
<i>Is it magnetism?</i>

03:42.472 --> 03:44.807
<i>That gold gauntlet is distinctive.</i>

03:45.308 --> 03:49.395
No, but then it's possible…

03:49.479 --> 03:51.689
No… Then what about…

03:51.773 --> 03:54.943
He's mumbling to himself.

03:55.026 --> 03:57.278
Licht-san will come up with something!

03:57.362 --> 03:59.280
Just like how he came up
with the firestorm

03:59.364 --> 04:00.949
and geothermal dissipation.

04:01.032 --> 04:04.118
Licht-san's ideas always save us.

04:04.619 --> 04:06.871
No, her appearance doesn't matter.

04:18.383 --> 04:22.303
Licht-san is a man that Company 8 needs!

04:22.387 --> 04:23.471
Magnetism…

04:24.264 --> 04:25.974
A pyrokinetic power…

04:27.517 --> 04:29.602
Gold itself isn't magnetic.

04:30.687 --> 04:32.897
And it isn't harmful to the pyrokinetic.

04:32.981 --> 04:35.775
Something related to fire or heat…

04:41.364 --> 04:43.408
Gold and magnetism…

04:43.491 --> 04:45.743
Flame and heat… Heat…

04:53.543 --> 04:54.877
Again?

05:01.342 --> 05:02.176
Gold and heat!

05:02.844 --> 05:06.639
<i>Vulcan-kun! Stop her from attacking</i>
<i>using Tekkyo at once!</i>

05:06.723 --> 05:08.891
Maki-san! Stop attacking now!

05:20.445 --> 05:22.071
<i>You're always like this.</i>

05:23.281 --> 05:26.534
<i>You act like you know everything</i>
<i>but don't say a word.</i>

05:26.617 --> 05:30.872
<i>You believe that you're right.</i>
<i>Everything ends with you.</i>

05:32.081 --> 05:33.708
<i>And I hate it!</i>

05:47.847 --> 05:49.891
She stopped Tekkyo?!

05:49.974 --> 05:51.559
Licht, what's going on?!

05:51.642 --> 05:54.520
It's gold! She's creating a magnetic field
using gold and heat!

05:56.105 --> 05:58.941
<i>Gold isn't affected by magnetism.</i>

05:59.025 --> 06:00.234
<i>It isn't attracted to magnets.</i>

06:01.194 --> 06:03.946
You mean she isn't
actually using magnetism?

06:04.530 --> 06:07.533
No, that's where the heat comes into play.

06:08.201 --> 06:12.789
<i>Gold produces a magnetic field</i>
<i>when heat flows through it.</i>

06:13.456 --> 06:15.041
Gold's power…

06:15.124 --> 06:16.584
She's a third-generation pyrokinetic.

06:16.667 --> 06:19.879
She sends heat energy that she
generates through her gold gauntlet,

06:19.962 --> 06:21.756
creating a magnetic field
that she can control.

06:21.839 --> 06:24.383
That's how she controls metals.

06:25.760 --> 06:27.470
No! She took Tekkyo?!

06:28.054 --> 06:30.264
The bullets and Tekkyo are made of iron.

06:30.348 --> 06:32.433
They're easily affected
by the magnetic field.

06:32.517 --> 06:36.187
I acquire weapons
for assassination on-site.

06:36.270 --> 06:38.147
It doesn't cost any money.

06:38.231 --> 06:39.565
Cha-ching.

06:45.571 --> 06:49.033
Don't, Lieutenant! Firing just
gives her more weapons!

06:54.997 --> 06:56.749
Even my discarded barrel?!

07:02.171 --> 07:03.005
They're coming back!

07:08.886 --> 07:11.055
You're quite quick on your feet.

07:13.433 --> 07:17.270
I'll keep her distracted, then use
these boosts that Vulcan made!

07:17.353 --> 07:19.021
Vulcan, what's that?!

07:19.105 --> 07:24.068
A tool to boost firepower made from
iron oxide and aluminum powders!

07:24.152 --> 07:25.570
If you light it on fire,

07:26.154 --> 07:30.741
it generates a thermite reaction
and seriously intense firepower!

07:34.036 --> 07:35.872
A tool to boost your firepower?

07:36.497 --> 07:39.083
Didn't you get something
from training in Asakusa?

07:39.167 --> 07:43.004
Yeah, I found new moves and got faster.

07:43.087 --> 07:49.051
But compared to Shinra and Arthur,
my basic firepower is weak.

07:49.135 --> 07:52.054
I mean, yeah, compared to them…

07:52.763 --> 07:55.725
The enemy is only going to get stronger.

07:56.267 --> 07:57.101
So…

07:57.602 --> 08:02.315
I want to do whatever I can
to be useful to everyone.

08:04.192 --> 08:05.026
Please.

08:09.280 --> 08:10.406
All right.

08:10.490 --> 08:12.450
If that's what you want,
just leave it to me!

08:12.533 --> 08:14.577
I'll make you something nice!

08:17.747 --> 08:19.499
Quite a bit of firepower.

08:19.582 --> 08:20.833
All right! Do it!

08:20.917 --> 08:25.213
Take this! Giant Nekomata Fireball!

08:38.518 --> 08:39.644
No way…

08:42.980 --> 08:45.358
A typical assassin
wouldn't have withstood it,

08:46.150 --> 08:50.321
but we Destroyers specialize
in assassinating pyrokinetics.

08:50.905 --> 08:54.492
Thus,
our flame resistance is high as well.

09:00.331 --> 09:01.207
Tamaki-chan!

09:08.631 --> 09:09.840
I can't move…

09:17.265 --> 09:18.432
That was close!

09:18.516 --> 09:21.227
Saved by my lucky lecher lure!

09:21.310 --> 09:22.812
Oh, good!

09:22.895 --> 09:25.231
That lucky lecher lure, though…

09:25.314 --> 09:27.233
Special Fire Force turnout coats
are made of

09:27.316 --> 09:30.570
a special Haijima heat-resistant plastic.

09:30.653 --> 09:33.531
The only metal part is on the belt.

09:33.614 --> 09:35.116
In other words…

09:38.661 --> 09:40.162
We need to do this!

09:41.414 --> 09:42.331
How unsightly.

09:42.415 --> 09:45.626
We strip for the nude calendar every year!

09:45.710 --> 09:46.752
We have no shame!

09:49.297 --> 09:51.132
Does it make you that much money?

09:51.215 --> 09:53.968
You've been living under
a rock in the Nether.

09:54.635 --> 09:55.886
They sell like hotcakes!

09:58.764 --> 10:01.684
She can't pull our bodies around anymore,

10:01.767 --> 10:04.645
but Tamaki's Giant Nekomata Fireball
didn't work. What can we do now?

10:05.354 --> 10:09.233
We can't use any of our weapons
while she's got that magnetic field!

10:09.317 --> 10:10.359
You in trouble?

10:13.404 --> 10:16.324
What're you dressed like a teddy bear for?

10:16.407 --> 10:18.284
It's no laughing matter!

10:18.367 --> 10:20.286
Lisa, you take your belt off too!

10:21.412 --> 10:24.040
Did you forget my power?

10:26.709 --> 10:27.960
Fishing Fire!

10:29.211 --> 10:31.339
My flames are magnetic!

10:31.422 --> 10:34.467
They should interfere
with the enemy's magnetic field.

10:35.384 --> 10:37.053
Lisa…

10:37.136 --> 10:38.804
Are you sure you can fight?

10:42.516 --> 10:45.895
I was formerly Feeler of the Knights
of the Ashen Flame.

10:46.687 --> 10:48.856
I can't sit squirming around!

10:50.983 --> 10:55.905
I was once your enemy, but Captain
Obi accepted me as one of you.

10:55.988 --> 10:58.532
I might not want it
as much as the rest of you,

10:58.616 --> 11:01.077
but I want to save Captain Obi too!

11:02.953 --> 11:04.830
The best I can do is buy some time.

11:04.914 --> 11:06.957
-Vul.
-You got it!

11:07.583 --> 11:12.254
<i>Licht, I heard how you said to stop.</i>
<i>You've already got a plan, right?</i>

11:14.548 --> 11:15.508
Of course.

11:16.008 --> 11:18.928
I'm the 8th's forensic science officer.

11:28.521 --> 11:31.941
The enemy, Gold,
is a third-generation pyrokinetic.

11:32.608 --> 11:35.111
Some half-baked flame
won't have any effect.

11:35.194 --> 11:36.404
The most effective means of fighting

11:36.487 --> 11:39.865
-Shoot, the shield…
-regardless of their flame resistance…

11:39.949 --> 11:42.827
Lietenant Hinawa's pistol
is perfect to finish her.

11:43.411 --> 11:45.788
There's a perfect target
on the enemy's forehead,

11:45.871 --> 11:48.791
but their magnetism
will only get in the way.

11:48.874 --> 11:52.253
So we need to neutralize
their magnetism first.

11:52.336 --> 11:55.172
For example, by using
a ferromagnetic material

11:55.256 --> 11:57.633
to overpower the gold
gauntlet's magnetic field.

11:57.716 --> 11:59.677
Ferromagnetic?

11:59.760 --> 12:02.346
Stuff that works on a magnetic field?
Where do we find that?

12:02.430 --> 12:04.223
It's all over the place.

12:08.727 --> 12:10.104
<i>Iron!</i>

12:10.187 --> 12:13.190
<i>We cover Gold's gold gauntlet with iron.</i>

12:13.274 --> 12:16.819
But they can manipulate iron!
It's impossible!

12:16.902 --> 12:19.363
Yes, it's impossible,
for normal people anyway.

12:19.447 --> 12:23.451
That's why only the Special
Fire Force can accomplish this.

12:24.952 --> 12:27.413
Gold, how long do you
plan on playing around?

12:27.496 --> 12:32.126
I thought time was money.
Destroy them now.

12:32.209 --> 12:35.379
They have no further means. It is over.

12:35.963 --> 12:38.382
-Another act, I suppose--
-Silence.

12:40.801 --> 12:42.386
Fishing Fire!

12:48.809 --> 12:51.353
What? Is my control off?

12:51.437 --> 12:53.272
Keep it up, Lisa!

12:53.355 --> 12:56.775
If the enemy adjusts to my
magnetic field, it's over for us!

12:57.359 --> 12:59.361
Vul, we don't have time! Make it quick!

13:00.196 --> 13:01.363
Right.

13:01.447 --> 13:05.576
Licht, what's this thing that only
the Special Fire Force can do?!

13:05.659 --> 13:08.829
All right. Listen closely.

13:13.334 --> 13:16.629
I get it! You're right!
We might be able to do this!

13:16.712 --> 13:20.132
<i>First, Crewman Tamaki, prepare your flame!</i>

13:20.216 --> 13:24.303
I didn't really get it,
but what do you want me to do?

13:25.763 --> 13:27.264
Licht, all ready!

13:27.348 --> 13:29.225
Seriously, what do you want me to do?!

13:29.808 --> 13:31.435
-Maki-san.
-I've got it.

13:37.441 --> 13:38.734
Allez cuisine.

13:38.817 --> 13:41.028
Tamaki, make a pot with your tails.

13:44.448 --> 13:45.950
Don't spill any.

13:46.909 --> 13:48.369
What?! Hey…

13:48.452 --> 13:50.287
First, we make a broth of molten iron.

13:50.371 --> 13:51.622
-A butt?!
-A broth.

13:51.705 --> 13:55.918
Hold up! My flame isn't
hot enough to melt iron!

13:56.001 --> 14:00.047
To melt iron, you need to heat it
to a temperature of 2,800 degrees.

14:00.130 --> 14:01.924
<i>Vulcan, can you do that?</i>

14:02.007 --> 14:03.342
You got it!

14:03.425 --> 14:05.052
First, I'll use a thermite reaction…

14:05.636 --> 14:07.763
-Ready, Maki-san?
-Okay!

14:07.846 --> 14:10.683
Hey! What're you doing to my butt?!

14:18.440 --> 14:20.359
It's nowhere near hot enough!

14:23.028 --> 14:25.573
What are you doing now?!
What the heck is that?!

14:25.656 --> 14:28.158
It's concentrated oxygen for breathing.

14:28.242 --> 14:31.745
We're using these to
bring it up to 2,800 degrees!

14:31.829 --> 14:33.497
Wh-What?!

14:39.044 --> 14:42.756
You are interfering
with your own magnetic field?

14:42.840 --> 14:45.301
I have already adjusted to it now.

14:48.345 --> 14:50.222
Vul! Are you ready yet?!

14:54.018 --> 14:56.687
What are you people doing behind her?

14:56.770 --> 14:59.106
Good job holding out, Lisa!

14:59.189 --> 15:00.024
Tamaki! Do it!

15:04.528 --> 15:06.196
What is that?

15:09.199 --> 15:10.659
Is that iron?

15:10.743 --> 15:13.537
I will use my magnetism
to take your iron--

15:15.080 --> 15:19.877
Too bad. Once iron reaches 770 degrees,
its material properties change.

15:19.960 --> 15:21.795
It's no longer magnetic!

15:26.842 --> 15:27.676
My gauntlet!

15:27.760 --> 15:31.096
Her gauntlet's gone!
Now she can't use magnetism!

15:31.180 --> 15:33.933
Just you try stopping this!

15:35.309 --> 15:36.560
Lietenant Hinawa!

15:41.398 --> 15:42.566
Hold up--

15:56.872 --> 15:58.999
We did it!

16:01.001 --> 16:02.544
Gold…

16:02.628 --> 16:04.254
…has been defeated.

16:05.589 --> 16:08.092
So it really was an act.

16:08.175 --> 16:10.177
I will go next.

16:10.260 --> 16:11.095
Do as you wish.

16:11.679 --> 16:14.139
You are no longer needed here.

16:14.223 --> 16:16.100
And neither is he.

16:18.894 --> 16:21.605
You see that?! The 8th's teamwork!

16:21.689 --> 16:24.024
All three of you could've fought us!

16:24.108 --> 16:25.943
You looked down on us!

16:26.026 --> 16:30.489
Unfortunately, we only know
how to fight alone.

16:31.407 --> 16:34.868
Next, I, Stream, will be your opponent.

16:34.952 --> 16:36.787
Blow, Anna!

16:37.997 --> 16:39.081
What's going on now?

16:39.164 --> 16:40.082
<i>Licht!</i>

16:40.165 --> 16:43.669
Visual clear. Beginning
analysis of the enemy's power!

16:45.087 --> 16:46.630
Tamaki, be careful!

16:46.714 --> 16:48.465
I've got flame resistance!

16:56.265 --> 16:57.516
Tamaki-chan?!

16:57.599 --> 16:59.643
Attacking with something
other than flame or heat?!

16:59.727 --> 17:05.107
Based on Crewman Tamaki's wound,
the enemy uses airflow from flames

17:05.691 --> 17:08.819
to attack using tornadoes and whirlwinds.

17:12.698 --> 17:14.366
Anna and Erica!

17:17.036 --> 17:19.246
Kris and Kate!

17:21.665 --> 17:22.958
Watch where you're aiming.

17:23.042 --> 17:24.084
He's fast!

17:24.168 --> 17:25.294
I can't analyze in time!

17:25.377 --> 17:28.213
First up, Erica the Confident!

17:31.800 --> 17:32.760
Lieutenant!

17:32.843 --> 17:34.136
Die.

17:40.225 --> 17:42.144
You are from the 8th as well?

17:42.227 --> 17:43.771
So there was another?

17:45.355 --> 17:48.609
My name is Knight King Arthur Boyle.

17:49.818 --> 17:52.696
I have no name to state for you.

17:52.780 --> 17:55.282
I see. Arthur Boyle.

17:55.365 --> 17:58.494
Then be enveloped by my
four beauties and die!

17:58.577 --> 18:00.370
Four Goddesses!

18:10.214 --> 18:13.092
VIOLET FLASH

18:13.175 --> 18:16.345
Stream the Gale, in an instant?

18:16.428 --> 18:18.430
Arthur! Where have you been?!

18:18.514 --> 18:20.641
You know
the 8th doesn't have enough hands!

18:20.724 --> 18:22.851
Why weren't you here?!

18:34.738 --> 18:38.075
ARTHUR'S LEG

18:40.869 --> 18:41.870
I fell off my horse.

18:48.168 --> 18:50.170
More silence?!

18:50.254 --> 18:53.382
After putting Captain Obi
through all this?!

18:54.007 --> 18:58.345
<i>If you didn't keep quiet</i>
<i>about the fire 12 years ago,</i>

18:58.929 --> 19:00.681
<i>I would've found Sho sooner…</i>

19:01.390 --> 19:04.935
Why did Sho have to
go through all that too?!

19:05.018 --> 19:08.897
Captain Burns, why help
the White-Clad when they did that?!

19:09.565 --> 19:13.026
Before all else, I am a servant of God.

19:13.110 --> 19:15.904
You are a priest and a Fire Soldier!

19:15.988 --> 19:18.740
Protecting the people
is a Fire Soldier's duty!

19:19.491 --> 19:25.998
You and I, before we are priest
and Fire Soldier, are only human.

19:26.081 --> 19:31.795
I have prayed constantly
for this country… for this world.

19:32.713 --> 19:36.091
I prayed for nothing for myself.

19:36.175 --> 19:41.388
The truth behind human combustion,
Sho, your mother…

19:41.471 --> 19:44.433
What have you sought in your prayers?

19:45.809 --> 19:49.104
Not one of your prayers has come true.

19:50.480 --> 19:53.817
And you will never
accomplish anything, ever.

19:53.901 --> 19:56.820
I swore that I'd become a hero!

19:56.904 --> 19:58.739
I'll save everyone!

20:04.870 --> 20:06.747
Insert the insect into Obi!

20:12.294 --> 20:13.962
Your prayers…

20:15.297 --> 20:16.632
Stop!

20:20.928 --> 20:23.388
…will never come true.

20:38.528 --> 20:42.950
TO BE CONTINUED

22:13.790 --> 22:15.584
<i>It seems that we have an emergency.</i>

22:15.667 --> 22:17.711
<i>Men, assist Captain Obi at once!</i>

22:17.794 --> 22:20.297
<i>Pitiful. Truly pitiful.</i>

22:20.380 --> 22:21.673
<i>Lieutenant, stand back.</i>

22:21.757 --> 22:23.175
<i>What? A dragon?</i>

22:23.258 --> 22:25.135
<i>Next time, "Old Enemies Reunited."</i>

22:25.218 --> 22:27.637
<i>Return to the great flame of fire. Látom.</i>
